WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:38.300
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.620 --> 01:41.100
[Episode 4]

01:54.200 --> 01:56.400
How's your cello practice
been going lately?

01:56.400 --> 01:57.280
It's okay.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.680
"Okay" isn't good enough.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.940
You need to be the best.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.200
Only by getting first place

02:01.200 --> 02:02.680
will people remember you.

02:02.680 --> 02:03.410
Understand?

02:04.100 --> 02:04.480
Mm.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.200
Ning...

02:11.000 --> 02:12.200
Never mind, nothing.

02:12.470 --> 02:13.470
Go on practicing.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.590
Let's go, Lan!

03:09.120 --> 03:10.430
I'm so envious.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.120
If only I could

03:12.120 --> 03:14.680
bring my own cello to perform.

03:16.710 --> 03:18.280
Just borrow one from them later.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.940
They shouldn't be that petty.

03:20.280 --> 03:20.960
Then you can go up

03:20.960 --> 03:21.840
and play with them.

03:21.840 --> 03:22.680
No way.

03:23.000 --> 03:24.840
Instruments are
precious personal belongings.

03:24.840 --> 03:26.360
We don't lend them out lightly.

03:26.360 --> 03:27.000
Forget it.

03:27.000 --> 03:28.000
I'll just listen.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.000
Sir,

03:45.240 --> 03:46.150
excuse me.

03:46.680 --> 03:48.010
That girl over there...

03:49.280 --> 03:49.710
I...

03:49.960 --> 03:51.220
I'll go get the coffee.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.000
Thanks.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.079
Come on.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.680
M... Me?

03:57.840 --> 03:58.360
Come on.

03:58.360 --> 03:58.870
Can I?

04:03.960 --> 04:04.710
Thank you.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.450
You've got this.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.840
What piece do you want to play, miss?

04:12.310 --> 04:13.590
The Concerto for Two Cellos?

04:13.590 --> 04:14.590
Of course.

04:15.750 --> 04:17.920
Aren't you usually the levelheaded one?

04:17.920 --> 04:20.040
Why didn't you explain it clearly
to our daughter?

04:20.040 --> 04:21.160
Don't you know what kind of temper

04:21.160 --> 04:22.420
your own daughter has?

04:22.870 --> 04:23.720
She's just like you—
proud and high-spirited

04:23.720 --> 04:24.720
since childhood.

04:25.360 --> 04:25.750
Now

04:25.920 --> 04:27.250
you're going to tell her

04:27.390 --> 04:29.160
the company went bankrupt
and we're in debt?

04:29.160 --> 04:30.960
You want me to just tell her that?

04:32.600 --> 04:33.159
Fine.

04:34.920 --> 04:37.120
Studying abroad is a major step in life.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.720
Before Ning goes abroad,

04:38.720 --> 04:40.320
I'll have the tuition ready.

04:41.190 --> 04:42.240
No matter what,

04:42.720 --> 04:44.520
Ning's future can't be delayed.

04:44.720 --> 04:45.950
She is our only daughter

04:45.950 --> 04:47.360
and all our hope.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.040
She must attend

04:49.040 --> 04:51.370
the best music conservatory in the world!

06:23.120 --> 06:30.220
[Reborn! We Got This]

06:32.159 --> 06:33.159
That was amazing.

06:35.750 --> 06:36.750
I have a call.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.070
Hello?

06:39.600 --> 06:40.190
Ning.

06:40.190 --> 06:41.510
I just saw the video Mengmeng

06:41.510 --> 06:42.920
shared in the group chat.

06:43.070 --> 06:44.190
You looked quite happy

06:44.190 --> 06:45.360
playing the cello.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.390
What's wrong?

06:48.390 --> 06:50.510
Your voice sounds a little strange.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.360
It's nothing.

06:53.950 --> 06:55.390
You can tell me, you know.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.750
In the future, if you're unhappy,

06:56.750 --> 06:58.150
you can always talk to me.

06:58.480 --> 07:00.270
I'll keep all your secrets.

07:02.830 --> 07:03.950
Then let me ask you—

07:04.720 --> 07:06.160
if one day

07:06.270 --> 07:07.070
you face

07:07.070 --> 07:08.160
a huge setback,

07:08.160 --> 07:09.160
what would you do?

07:12.830 --> 07:15.040
A huge setback...

07:17.270 --> 07:18.950
I once read that

07:19.630 --> 07:20.720
if fate

07:21.270 --> 07:22.190
wants to give you

07:22.190 --> 07:23.590
a really wonderful gift,

07:24.040 --> 07:25.970
it will first push you to the brink—

07:27.070 --> 07:29.600
so you'll be strong enough to catch it.

07:30.190 --> 07:31.510
When things hit rock bottom,
they turn around—

07:31.510 --> 07:33.570
every dark night ends at dawn, right?

07:34.630 --> 07:35.600
The brink...

07:41.830 --> 07:43.920
If that gift really exists,

07:44.480 --> 07:45.830
I hope that one day

07:46.720 --> 07:48.830
I'll play the cello on the greatest stage

07:48.830 --> 07:49.720
in the world.

07:55.510 --> 07:56.390
Me too.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.360
Right now,

08:00.070 --> 08:01.600
I'm 100% sure

08:02.510 --> 08:04.170
that I love playing the cello.

08:05.950 --> 08:06.830
Then let's

08:07.070 --> 08:08.160
never give up.

08:09.160 --> 08:09.890
Let's always

08:10.190 --> 08:11.850
love playing the cello, okay?

08:12.070 --> 08:12.600
Okay.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.000
I believe in you.

08:15.950 --> 08:16.550
Thank you.

08:24.340 --> 08:27.220
["International Cello Program";
Study Abroad with Scholarship]

08:35.200 --> 08:36.030
One floor,

08:36.360 --> 08:37.150
two floors,

08:37.150 --> 08:37.960
three floors.

08:38.600 --> 08:40.000
How big is it altogether?

08:40.150 --> 08:41.390
I've never thought about it.

08:41.390 --> 08:43.360
Maybe two or three thousand square meters.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.480
That big?

08:44.870 --> 08:47.360
You even have a private elevator and pool.

08:47.600 --> 08:49.860
It's all thanks to my parents' hard work.

08:49.960 --> 08:51.720
I wish I had parents like yours.

08:51.720 --> 08:52.600
Me too!

08:52.600 --> 08:53.870
Me too!

08:54.320 --> 08:55.360
No way.

08:59.360 --> 09:00.290
I'm telling you,

09:00.320 --> 09:02.120
the hardest part of a barbecue

09:02.120 --> 09:03.200
is getting the fire started.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.400
But I have already...

09:04.600 --> 09:05.480
got it started.

09:05.480 --> 09:06.720
Amazing, so amazing.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.080
So when can we eat?

09:08.320 --> 09:08.840
Relax.

09:08.840 --> 09:10.570
It needs to burn a while longer.

09:14.870 --> 09:16.360
Tong Xiaole, stop filming.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.550
Come help set up!

09:18.480 --> 09:19.010
I'm busy.

09:26.200 --> 09:26.720
Alright,

09:26.720 --> 09:27.720
the fire is ready!

09:27.720 --> 09:28.180
Xiaole,

09:28.440 --> 09:29.870
bring the oil and skewers over.

09:29.870 --> 09:31.080
I'm about to start grilling them.

09:31.080 --> 09:31.480
Okay.

09:31.670 --> 09:32.360
The oil...

09:32.360 --> 09:33.960
For that, we've gotta ask
Tong Xiaole to do it.

09:33.960 --> 09:35.840
He lies through his teeth all the time.

09:35.840 --> 09:37.970
He's basically a walking greaseball.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.370
What's wrong, greaseball?

09:48.480 --> 09:49.410
Where's the oil?

09:50.200 --> 09:51.600
Isn't the oil right here?

09:55.720 --> 09:57.670
Are you sure
you've got the grilling covered,

09:57.670 --> 09:58.200
Mr. Chen?

09:59.120 --> 10:00.480
Leave it to me.

10:03.550 --> 10:04.080
Mr. Chen,

10:04.080 --> 10:05.720
your villa is great and all,

10:05.720 --> 10:07.080
except that the temperature difference

10:07.080 --> 10:07.960
between day and night is too huge.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.290
You're being picky now?

10:14.960 --> 10:16.420
Chen Fan, do you need help?

10:16.840 --> 10:18.360
Sure. Help me grab

10:18.840 --> 10:20.370
the mushrooms on the table.

10:20.440 --> 10:22.080
I picked them from the hill
behind our house.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.200
I love mushrooms.

10:23.480 --> 10:25.080
Picked from the back hill...

10:25.080 --> 10:26.940
They're not poisonous, are they?

10:27.720 --> 10:28.550
Let me see.

10:31.870 --> 10:32.840
Do you remember

10:32.840 --> 10:34.080
my dad teaching us

10:35.200 --> 10:36.080
how to

10:36.360 --> 10:38.490
identify mushrooms when we were kids?

10:38.790 --> 10:39.600
This kind...

10:39.870 --> 10:41.840
should be edible, right?

10:42.840 --> 10:44.200
I don't remember.

10:44.790 --> 10:45.920
It should be edible!

10:48.120 --> 10:48.720
Should be shiitake.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.320
That's right.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.200
Just eat without worry.

10:50.200 --> 10:52.360
Then I'm going to pig out later.

10:53.840 --> 10:55.720
Help me grill the mushrooms.

10:55.960 --> 10:56.480
Okay.

10:56.960 --> 10:58.080
These are done, right?

10:58.080 --> 10:58.960
Yes, yes, yes.

11:02.000 --> 11:02.480
Coming.

11:03.840 --> 11:04.840
I'm starving.

11:04.840 --> 11:05.720
Everyone, grab a few skewers.

11:05.720 --> 11:06.600
Thank you.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.480
Thank you.

11:18.720 --> 11:19.240
Not bad skills,

11:19.240 --> 11:19.840
Mr. Chen.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.550
Here you go!

11:26.790 --> 11:27.670
Smells so good!

11:34.080 --> 11:34.600
Yi Lan,

11:34.870 --> 11:36.080
don't you like mushrooms?

11:36.080 --> 11:36.840
There's mushroom soup here.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.480
Have some?

11:37.600 --> 11:38.200
Okay.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.240
Is it ready?

11:39.790 --> 11:40.870
Ready.

11:41.720 --> 11:42.670
Thanks.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.200
Here.

11:52.840 --> 11:53.360
Here.

11:53.550 --> 11:54.670
Thanks.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.560
Have some mushrooms.

11:56.870 --> 11:58.870
Mushrooms taste best when grilled.

12:06.360 --> 12:07.820
Wild mushrooms really are

12:08.080 --> 12:09.010
something else.

12:16.360 --> 12:18.630
If only there were stars in the sky.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.550
It's raining.

12:25.790 --> 12:26.870
No way.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.960
Which idiot picked this "perfect" day?

12:36.960 --> 12:37.840
Unbelievable.

12:37.840 --> 12:38.320
You picked it!

12:38.320 --> 12:38.790
You did!

12:38.790 --> 12:39.240
You did!

12:39.240 --> 12:39.790
You did!

12:39.790 --> 12:40.320
You did!

12:40.320 --> 12:41.080
Whoever picked it is an idiot!

12:41.080 --> 12:41.840
I picked it.

12:47.240 --> 12:50.000
Well, I think rainy days are kind of nice.

12:57.750 --> 12:58.480
What else

12:58.480 --> 13:00.480
can we do on a rainy day?

13:02.120 --> 13:03.200
I'm going to shower first.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.400
Don't fight me for it!

13:06.120 --> 13:07.980
The barbecue was soaked through.

13:08.120 --> 13:08.790
I'll go check

13:08.790 --> 13:10.590
if there's anything else to eat.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.960
I'm going to charge my phone.

13:56.600 --> 13:58.130
He took so many photos of me.

14:05.600 --> 14:06.670
You took all those photos of me

14:06.670 --> 14:08.330
and won't even let me see them?

14:08.790 --> 14:10.590
Didn't the battery die just now?

14:13.870 --> 14:14.600
Give it to me.

14:14.600 --> 14:16.360
I haven't picked a profile picture yet.

14:16.360 --> 14:17.870
Didn't you come up to find food?

14:17.870 --> 14:18.800
Did you find any?

14:18.840 --> 14:19.480
Not yet.

14:19.960 --> 14:21.000
Then let me see the photos first!

14:21.000 --> 14:23.730
I remember Chen Fan's place
has some down here...

14:29.600 --> 14:30.660
There's food here!

14:30.870 --> 14:31.550
Let me see!

14:31.550 --> 14:32.000
Look over there!

14:32.000 --> 14:32.660
There's...

14:38.200 --> 14:39.390
W-Why did it go dark?

14:40.670 --> 14:41.800
Did the power go out?

14:43.360 --> 14:44.480
The power's out?

14:47.200 --> 14:47.840
Where is Mengmeng?

14:47.840 --> 14:48.440
Mengmeng!

14:48.600 --> 14:49.200
Lan!

14:49.200 --> 14:49.800
Mengmeng!

14:50.080 --> 14:51.200
Lan, Lan,

14:51.200 --> 14:52.670
I'm scared to be alone,

14:52.670 --> 14:53.240
Lan!

14:53.240 --> 14:54.320
You grabbed the wrong person.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.200
I'm here.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.080
Lan.

14:56.870 --> 14:58.080
I'm scared too.

14:58.200 --> 14:58.960
What should we do now?

14:58.960 --> 14:59.820
How about this—

14:59.960 --> 15:00.960
you two wait here.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.810
I'll go down and check.

15:03.240 --> 15:04.480
Don't go! Don't go!

15:04.480 --> 15:05.440
Xiaole!

15:06.600 --> 15:08.730
Then... let's slowly feel our way out.

15:15.000 --> 15:16.320
Why is it so dark?

15:18.240 --> 15:19.640
Probably a power outage.

15:21.150 --> 15:22.320
Why is it raining?

15:22.870 --> 15:24.870
Wasn't it already raining just now?

15:25.080 --> 15:26.080
I'm so dizzy!

15:26.080 --> 15:26.720
It's the lightning.

15:26.720 --> 15:28.780
Thunder and rain are totally normal.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.240
The Water Curtain Cave.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.600
Water Curtain Cave!

15:37.840 --> 15:38.790
There's a horse!

15:39.790 --> 15:40.390
It's fake.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.120
Horse.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.480
Horse.

15:43.510 --> 15:44.120
Horse.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.690
Stop imagining things.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.720
We live in a scientific world, okay?

15:47.720 --> 15:49.440
Stick to materialism, alright?

15:49.440 --> 15:50.240
Materialism.

15:53.320 --> 15:54.630
Who? Who did that?

15:55.120 --> 15:55.670
Chen Fan,

15:55.670 --> 15:56.790
can you not pop out like that?

15:56.790 --> 15:57.720
You scared us half to death!

15:57.720 --> 15:59.030
Chen Fan!

15:59.440 --> 16:01.480
I'm scared to be alone.

16:01.480 --> 16:02.740
Let's stick together.

16:04.240 --> 16:06.120
W-What's wrong?

16:06.120 --> 16:07.870
It looked like a figure over there!

16:07.870 --> 16:08.670
There was a figure?

16:08.670 --> 16:09.600
Where?

16:09.600 --> 16:10.240
Bro,

16:10.240 --> 16:12.440
that's your face-shaped sofa!

16:13.240 --> 16:14.200
Unbelievable.

16:14.360 --> 16:16.090
Where is your circuit breaker?

16:17.000 --> 16:17.670
By the door.

16:17.670 --> 16:18.720
Go flip the switch, hurry.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.480
You're brave.

16:19.480 --> 16:21.080
-You go!
-You go!

16:21.080 --> 16:22.320
Of course I can go!

16:22.320 --> 16:23.000
But if I go,

16:23.000 --> 16:24.200
who will protect you?

16:24.360 --> 16:25.720
This is your house!

16:25.720 --> 16:26.650
You want me to go?

16:27.440 --> 16:28.170
Don't worry!

16:28.200 --> 16:29.200
I'll protect you!

16:29.870 --> 16:30.840
Let's do this—

16:31.200 --> 16:32.480
Yi Lan, you on my left,

16:32.550 --> 16:33.480
and Qiao Mengmeng, you on my right.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.940
I-I'll stand on your left.

16:36.870 --> 16:38.240
Let's go together.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.200
Wait a second!

16:39.440 --> 16:41.840
Isn't this formation just protecting you?

16:43.480 --> 16:44.440
I figured

16:44.440 --> 16:45.840
if anything happens to any of you,

16:45.840 --> 16:47.000
I can rush to your rescue

16:47.000 --> 16:48.080
immediately!

16:48.360 --> 16:49.480
Coward!

16:49.480 --> 16:51.080
Alright!

16:51.080 --> 16:52.440
Let's move!

16:52.440 --> 16:53.080
Let's go!

16:56.670 --> 16:57.470
Open the door.

16:57.670 --> 16:58.060
Open the door.

16:58.060 --> 16:58.530
Open the door.

16:58.530 --> 16:59.330
Open the door.

17:09.829 --> 17:12.480
I still haven't achieved my dreams!

17:12.480 --> 17:13.589
I'm too young to die!

17:13.589 --> 17:14.829
Help!

17:22.240 --> 17:23.240
It sounds like someone's knocking.

17:23.240 --> 17:24.440
Go check it out!

17:25.000 --> 17:26.030
It's a person knocking!

17:26.030 --> 17:27.069
A person knocking!

17:27.069 --> 17:28.160
Knocking on the door!

17:28.160 --> 17:30.070
Only humans can knock on something, right?

17:30.070 --> 17:31.240
You go!

17:31.240 --> 17:32.350
Come on, let's go!

17:32.350 --> 17:33.110
If I go,

17:33.110 --> 17:34.310
who will protect you?

17:34.920 --> 17:35.920
Hurry up! Come on!

17:39.830 --> 17:40.440
Hurry!

17:43.790 --> 17:45.240
I don't want to!

17:47.310 --> 17:48.110
Wait!

17:51.550 --> 17:52.310
You go!

17:52.310 --> 17:53.160
Y-You go!

17:53.160 --> 17:54.020
Hurry up and go!

17:58.270 --> 17:59.000
I'm going then.

17:59.000 --> 17:59.440
Go.

18:14.830 --> 18:16.110
Y-You can do it.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.110
See? No one's there!

18:37.110 --> 18:38.350
I'm Zhao Zhenghao!

18:39.030 --> 18:40.360
It's me, Zhao Zhenghao!

18:40.440 --> 18:41.350
Zhao Zhenghao?

18:41.830 --> 18:43.440
Xiaole! Xiaole!

18:44.270 --> 18:45.270
Well, I think he's

18:45.270 --> 18:46.440
Zhao Zhenghao!

18:49.440 --> 18:50.400
Zhao Zhenghao?

18:50.680 --> 18:51.550
Zhao Zhenghao?

19:05.200 --> 19:06.330
Finally warming up.

19:08.160 --> 19:08.920
Xiaole.

19:09.240 --> 19:10.960
You hit me way too hard.

19:11.680 --> 19:12.680
Sorry about that.

19:13.000 --> 19:15.350
I trained at the Shaolin Temple as a kid.

19:15.350 --> 19:16.070
That was

19:16.070 --> 19:18.000
pure muscle memory.

19:18.750 --> 19:20.920
Then let's settle this man to man.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.400
Alright, that's enough.

19:22.400 --> 19:23.880
Don't ask for trouble.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.320
Tell us, why did you come?

19:29.590 --> 19:30.590
I invited him.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.310
I think you guys

19:33.310 --> 19:35.790
might have had a tiny misunderstanding.

19:36.550 --> 19:39.030
Well, Zhao Zhenghao is pretty handsome.

19:39.030 --> 19:41.760
You can take this chance to
get to know him better.

19:43.240 --> 19:44.240
To find you guys...

19:44.240 --> 19:45.510
Look at this heavy rain.

19:45.510 --> 19:47.270
I risked my life to come here.

19:47.750 --> 19:49.510
Shouldn't you welcome me?

19:52.790 --> 19:54.270
We're hungry and sleepy.

19:54.270 --> 19:55.530
How can we welcome you?

19:56.030 --> 19:57.110
I'm hungry too.

19:57.110 --> 19:59.040
I haven't eaten anything tonight.

20:00.750 --> 20:01.920
Where are you going?

20:05.030 --> 20:06.070
Zhao Zhenghao!

20:06.070 --> 20:06.920
The barbecue outside

20:06.920 --> 20:08.320
is all soaked by the rain.

20:08.350 --> 20:09.680
We can't eat it anymore!

20:18.510 --> 20:20.070
Look, let's share.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.890
Zhao Zhenghao, you're so nice.

20:22.110 --> 20:23.240
In such heavy rain,

20:23.270 --> 20:25.240
you still came all this way to find us.

20:25.240 --> 20:26.550
Zhao Zhenghao, I didn't expect

20:26.550 --> 20:28.150
you to be such a loyal friend.

20:28.310 --> 20:30.160
How did I not notice before?

20:30.160 --> 20:31.030
Exactly.

20:31.030 --> 20:33.160
Zhao Zhenghao, you're handsome and loyal.

20:33.160 --> 20:34.550
We should get to know him better.

20:34.550 --> 20:36.000
You might not know me well.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.200
I'm a really nice guy.

20:38.160 --> 20:40.560
We can start getting to
know each other now.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.640
I feel so sleepy.

20:44.920 --> 20:45.720
What?

20:46.030 --> 20:47.960
I just got here, and you're sleepy?

20:48.350 --> 20:49.350
Get up and party!

20:52.830 --> 20:53.830
I've got to hand it to you.

20:53.830 --> 20:54.920
After coming all this way,

20:54.920 --> 20:56.920
how do you still have so much energy?

20:57.590 --> 20:58.310
Do you think

20:59.110 --> 21:00.550
the mushrooms we just ate

21:00.680 --> 21:01.830
are okay?

21:04.550 --> 21:06.010
You said they were edible.

21:06.070 --> 21:07.880
I told you they were poisonous.

21:11.790 --> 21:13.790
Hear me well:

21:14.070 --> 21:15.400
to prevent

21:15.640 --> 21:17.070
any further accidents,

21:18.000 --> 21:18.750
I suggest

21:19.070 --> 21:20.830
that we go to sleep right now.

21:23.640 --> 21:24.440
Hello, Dad.

21:25.350 --> 21:27.110
I ate something bad last night.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.070
What did you eat?

21:28.070 --> 21:28.880
Mushrooms.

21:29.070 --> 21:30.510
How could you be so careless?

21:30.510 --> 21:31.720
I ate the most.

21:31.920 --> 21:32.980
What are you doing?

21:33.830 --> 21:35.000
Xiaole is here!

21:35.200 --> 21:35.680
Look.

21:36.110 --> 21:36.680
Hello, Uncle Dong.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.350
Hello, Xiaole.

21:37.350 --> 21:38.070
We're all together.

21:38.070 --> 21:39.070
Don't worry.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.110
It's beautiful here.

21:41.590 --> 21:42.240
Look.

21:42.830 --> 21:44.230
The environment is nice.

21:45.070 --> 21:46.600
The weather is great today.

21:46.790 --> 21:47.750
Have fun then.

21:48.310 --> 21:49.370
What are you doing?

21:54.240 --> 21:55.550
Mom, I'm fine.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.350
I'm safe.

21:56.550 --> 21:57.350
Come back soon.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.480
I'll be back very soon.

21:58.480 --> 21:59.070
Come on, come on!

21:59.070 --> 22:00.270
Breakfast is here!

22:00.720 --> 22:01.270
Xiaole,

22:01.350 --> 22:02.200
come on.

22:02.440 --> 22:03.030
Xiaole.

22:03.830 --> 22:04.750
Where is my son?

22:05.350 --> 22:07.200
Chen Fan? Chen Fan!

22:08.510 --> 22:10.680
Here! Coming!

22:10.880 --> 22:11.400
Come on!

22:11.400 --> 22:12.160
Breakfast is ready!

22:12.160 --> 22:14.510
Mom, Mom, Mom.

22:15.400 --> 22:17.550
Honestly, you kids...

22:17.550 --> 22:18.440
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

22:18.440 --> 22:20.240
I would've come over last night
if I'd known!

22:20.240 --> 22:21.310
Come on.

22:21.310 --> 22:23.270
Fan, have a fried dough stick.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.640
This is for you.

22:28.110 --> 22:29.270
Here, for you two.

22:29.790 --> 22:30.880
Thank you, Auntie.

22:33.590 --> 22:34.790
Who hasn't got one? Here.

22:34.790 --> 22:35.350
Stop talking.

22:35.350 --> 22:36.240
Just eat.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.640
You must be starving.

22:41.510 --> 22:43.440
There are more fried dough sticks.

22:44.070 --> 22:45.240
So sweet.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.270
Not happy?

23:10.680 --> 23:11.240
No.

23:11.790 --> 23:13.310
The last piece of nougat.

23:13.310 --> 23:15.040
I'll give it to you—make a wish.

23:19.350 --> 23:20.110
Thanks.

23:22.440 --> 23:23.350
Look!

23:23.590 --> 23:24.650
There's a rainbow!

23:24.830 --> 23:25.640
Look, look!

23:26.350 --> 23:27.160
Do you see it?

23:28.440 --> 23:29.270
Where?

23:29.830 --> 23:30.830
Only happy people

23:30.830 --> 23:32.110
can see it.

23:33.640 --> 23:34.640
No wonder then.

23:37.110 --> 23:37.830
Do you remember

23:37.830 --> 23:39.750
that song we sang in kindergarten,

23:39.750 --> 23:40.440
"Come On"?

23:40.790 --> 23:42.350
The song the teacher kept making you sing

23:42.350 --> 23:44.350
as punishment
for causing trouble in class?

23:44.350 --> 23:46.070
It was obviously you
who always pulled my pigtails

23:46.070 --> 23:47.470
and got punished to sing.

23:47.790 --> 23:49.030
Don't think that
just because you have good grades now,

23:49.030 --> 23:49.680
nobody remembers

23:49.680 --> 23:50.830
what you were like as a kid.

23:50.830 --> 23:51.830
Don't slander me.

23:51.830 --> 23:52.830
Talk is cheap.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.960
Where's your proof?

23:54.510 --> 23:56.030
Hello there. Come on.

23:56.030 --> 23:57.550
Wait for me!

23:58.070 --> 23:58.880
Happiness

23:58.880 --> 24:00.920
is waiting for everyone ahead!

24:00.920 --> 24:01.590
Let go of me!

24:01.590 --> 24:02.350
Hello there.

24:02.350 --> 24:03.240
Come on!

24:03.240 --> 24:04.400
This is so embarrassing!

24:04.400 --> 24:05.110
Let go of me!

24:05.790 --> 24:06.400
Don't run!

24:06.400 --> 24:08.060
Dance by yourself if you want!

24:09.590 --> 24:11.190
I'm feeling much better now.

24:12.270 --> 24:13.400
You really shouldn't

24:13.400 --> 24:15.600
participate in such activities again.

24:16.880 --> 24:17.880
If something like that happens again,

24:17.880 --> 24:19.160
call Dad immediately.

24:19.920 --> 24:21.750
Dad will come over right away

24:22.070 --> 24:22.590
to protect you.

24:22.590 --> 24:23.240
Alright, alright,

24:23.240 --> 24:24.100
that's enough.

24:24.270 --> 24:24.790
Lan,

24:24.790 --> 24:26.030
have some hot soup, quickly.

24:26.030 --> 24:26.680
Okay.

24:45.730 --> 24:46.000
[Home] [Explore] [Food]

24:46.170 --> 24:47.430
[Food]

24:47.670 --> 24:48.590
[Rou jia mo]

24:48.240 --> 24:49.240
Xiaole!

24:48.620 --> 24:49.100
[Food]

24:50.270 --> 24:51.640
Tong Xiaole, open the door!

24:51.640 --> 24:52.680
Coming!

24:57.400 --> 24:58.590
You must be starving!

24:58.590 --> 25:00.250
I brought you something good!

25:00.270 --> 25:00.920
Come in!

25:03.790 --> 25:04.510
Come on.

25:04.880 --> 25:06.750
Let me see what good food you brought.

25:06.750 --> 25:08.110
Braised chicken.

25:13.160 --> 25:14.070
It's still hot.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.070
Eat up.

25:15.070 --> 25:17.160
I'll put this container
in the fridge for you.

25:17.160 --> 25:17.440
Okay.

25:17.440 --> 25:19.640
Heat it up yourself when you're hungry.

25:30.310 --> 25:31.680
I peeled these.

25:34.030 --> 25:34.920
You're improving.
